+echo "=== 12) Done: staging provisioning & initial checks complete ==="
+echo "Next: monitor long-shadow supervisor daily, run acceptance flows (30-day long-shadow), collect SME signoffs (ops/scripts/collect_sme_signoff.sh) and finalize production readiness."
